{"title":"Career Roadmap · Clay Modeller","role":"Clay Modeller","summary":"A Clay Modeller converts automotive design concepts, sketches, and digital models into accurate physical clay models. The role sits at the intersection of automotive design, sculpture, proportion, surface development, craftsmanship and digital modelling, and is especially important during vehicle concept and design-development stages.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Transportation / Automobile Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Years","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Drawing, form, proportion, materials"}],[{"text":"Development"},{"text":"2027–2028"},{"text":"Automotive surfacing and clay techniques"}],[{"text":"Digital + Physical"},{"text":"2028–2029"},{"text":"CAD + clay integration"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"2029–2030"},{"text":"Clay Modelling Trainee / Intern"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Production-quality vehicle models"}],[{"text":"Professional"},{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Full-scale modelling and surfacing"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"2037–2040"},{"text":"Senior Modeller / Specialist"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Model Shop Lead / Design Studio Leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design & Form Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"The first year should establish strong 3D form understanding."},{"type":"h","text":"Design fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design principles"},{"text":"Shape and form"},{"text":"Proportion"},{"text":"Scale"},{"text":"Perspective"},{"text":"Composition"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Visual communication"},{"text":"Sketching"},{"text":"Product form development"}]},{"type":"h","text":