s"},{"text":"Compact mobility"},{"text":"Autonomous vehicles"},{"text":"Charging interfaces"},{"text":"Interior transformation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI and Future of Clay Modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly assist automotive designers and modellers with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Concept generation"},{"text":"Design variations"},{"text":"Image-to-3D workflows"},{"text":"Digital surface exploration"},{"text":"Parametric modelling"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"Design optimisation"},{"text":"3D scanning"},{"text":"Surface comparison"},{"text":"Automated documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, physical modelling remains valuable because designers need to evaluate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Real proportions"},{"text":"Reflections"},{"text":"Tactile surfaces"},{"text":"Human perception"},{"text":"Physical scale"},{"text":"Surface transitions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest future profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Clay Modelling","Automotive Surfacing","CAD","3D Scanning","Digital Manufacturing","AI-assisted Design"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Automotive model-making is likely to become increasingly hybrid."},{"type":"p","text":"Future studios may use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-generated design concepts"},{"text":"Generative vehicle architectures"},{"text":"Advanced digital clay"},{"text":"Robotic clay milling"},{"text":"CNC machining"},{"text":"Large-format 3D printing"},{"text":"Automated scanning"},{"text":"XR design reviews"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Real-time collaborative design"},{"text":"AI-assisted surface optimisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The modeller's role will evolve from purely manual craftsmanship toward physical-digital model development."},{"type":"p","text":"The ability to understand both a physical surface and its digital representation will become increasingly valuable."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final